<title>EGYPT: Egypt cumulative cotton exports 62,741 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Egypt cumulative cotton exports 62,741 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt made new commitments to export 33 tonnes of cotton in the 26th week of the marketing season, bringing the total so far this season to 62,741 tonnes, the Alexandria Cotton Exporters Association (Alcotexa) said on Monday. The 26th week ended on Saturday.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
